  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indigenous Woodland Restoration &amp; Carbon Credits Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">My Trees concept note is looking for support in three key areas: 
1.Seed collection and storage: In order to continue to develop its tree planting operations, My Trees intend to scale up its indigenous seed collection in order to be able to produce 1,000,000 trees a year. 
2.	Nursery expansion: My Trees currently has 30 nurseries across the country which can produce just over 600,000 seedlings a year.
3.	Carbon credit project registration and capacity building: Community afforestation projects have the potential to address some of the environmental damage deforestation has caused in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </description>
